{"id":"60c7ba64b8865701","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-theorem.md","title":"Theorem (Provable Sentence)","display":"df-theorem — Theorem (Provable Sentence)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-theorem","aliases":["92-df-theorem"],"display":"df-theorem — Theorem (Provable Sentence)","depends_on":["[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-g-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theorem — Theorem (Provable Sentence)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Thm}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Thm}_G\\)</span> (definition-target theorem set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Thm}_G\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid G\\vdash\\varphi\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Thm}_G\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid G\\vdash\\varphi\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Thm}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Thm}_G\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的定理集</li>\n<li>定理 = 可证句子</li>\n<li>每个定理都有证明序列</li>\n<li>记号<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span>只有在另行约定为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的句法闭包时才可与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Thm}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Thm}_G\\)</span>互换；它有时也表示某个结构的全部真句，不能无说明混用</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Thm}_G\\neq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Thm}_G\\neq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span>只说明并非每个句子都可证，甚至相容且句法完备的理论也满足这一点；句法不完备要求存在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>使<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\nvdash\\varphi\">\\(G\\nvdash\\varphi\\)</span>且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi\">\\(G\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>对Gödel句子的双向不可证结论必须保留<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的有效可公理化、算术强度及相应一致性假设</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e024